## Current phase: {{phase}}

- **Workspace and entry.** Use `{{worktree}}` as command cwd and session/file-tool workspace.
  Run `wf notes` once in this context; follow its workspace-binding guidance before working.
  Keep the configured entry used by the commands below; a shell cwd alone does not bind file tools.
- **Saved inputs.** Read `{{folder}}/TICKET.md` for the complete request, thread, attachments and scope.
  Read the whole working document `{{folder}}/{{file}}` for verification, evidence and recorded decisions,
  following relevant log/capture links. Agreement creates missing records; build and assessment use
  the existing records. Inline excerpts below orient you, not replace those files or their sources.
- **Instruction scope.** Do only the {{phase}} work below; earlier phase procedures are not current
  assignments. Agreed scope, recorded decisions and applicable corrections still bind this phase.
  Keep work inside this round, respect protected files and hooks, and preserve prior review verdicts.
- **New decisions or blockers.** Follow `{{skill}}/references/questions.md` to register a
  question and record the person's actual ruling. Changed agreed behavior uses `wf decide --revise`
  and renewed agreement before dependent work; silence or an Inbox reply alone supplies no approval.
- **New authored instructions.** Follow `{{skill}}/references/corrections.md` when a person
  gives a round-linked instruction; save its source and words rather than relying on this chat.
